{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Trackers","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Trackers\/Enricher"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Trackers\/Enricher\/network()"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/standardcontext\/trackers\/enricher\/network()"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"network()","extendedModule":"Trackers","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"network"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["Trackers"],"name":"StandardContext"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV15StandardContextE7networkACyFZ","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Enricher+Network.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/StandardContext\/Enricher+Network.swift#L20"}},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An enricher that sets every record’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to the connection the device uses when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the tracker’s worker reaches it."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV